#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/index.md:8
msgid "Install the daemon"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Snaps are app packages for desktop, cloud and IoT that are easy to install, "
"secure, cross-platform and dependency-free."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/index.md:12
msgid ""
"The snap daemon, known as *snapd*, is the background service that manages "
"and maintains your snaps. It needs to be  running before a snap can be "
"installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/index.md:14
msgid ""
"Fortunately, the snap daemon is pre-installed and running on many "
"distributions by default, and it's easy to install on most other "
"distributions."
msgstr ""

